  "introduction": "<div id=\"paris\" class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 conference-title\">\n<h1>OpenStack Conference Fall 2014</h1>\n<h2>November 3-7, 2014, Paris, France</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12  conference-summary\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div id=\"paris-cal\" class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-4 conference-calendar\">\n<p class=\"date\">November 3-7, 2014</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"two-events\" class=\"col-lg-5 col-md-5 col-sm-5\">\n<p>The OpenStack Summit is a five-day conference for developers, users, and administrators of OpenStack Cloud Software.<br/> See <a href=\"/summit/openstack-paris-summit-2014/format-and-passes/\">details about how the event works</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-sm-3 register\">\n<p><a class=\"tracking-link\" href=\"https://openstacksummitnov2014.eventbrite.com?aff=summithomepage\">Register</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
